{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core Trials is a motion-based, pixel-art bullet hell you play using just your webcam. Move your body to control the core, protect it, and survive intense trials. Immerse yourself in high-octane action and uncover the true power of your core!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dodge to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/extras/Hit-_Compressed.gif?t=1739860349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Core Trials, you literally control the core with your body! Move, dash, jump, duck, and dive to dodge the relentless attacks of the Trial Masters. Every move matters\u2014no buttons, no controllers, just you and your core!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn from Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/extras/Dodge3-_Compressed.gif?t=1739860349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Trial Master brings a new challenge to overcome. Every failure is a lesson in growth. Study their patterns, adapt, and return stronger. It\u2019s not just about reflexes\u2014it\u2019s about evolving into the true Master of Core.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pixel-Perfect Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/extras/Screenshots.gif?t=1739860349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core Trials blends retro charm with modern challenge. Wrapped in nostalgic pixel-art style, it seems simple\u2014but don\u2019t be deceived. Sharp focus is essential. Be slow, and the Masters will humble you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover the Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/extras/Map-_Compressed.gif?t=1739860349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the tainted lands of Amargi. The Masters, once protectors of this realm, now guard forgotten truths. You are the chosen one, the last of many who bore the Core. Journey through the lands, rivers, mountains, and seas to unravel the history.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2549160?t=1739860349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2549160?t=1739860349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/bcd94cd5742fbe13654f5153c9844f726edd2774/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739860349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/bcd94cd5742fbe13654f5153c9844f726edd2774/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739860349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3486860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core Trials is a motion-based, pixel-art bullet hell you play using just your webcam. Move your body to control the core, protect it, and survive intense trials. Immerse yourself in high-octane action and uncover the true power of your core!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dodge to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/extras/Hit-_Compressed.gif?t=1739860349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Core Trials, you literally control the core with your body! Move, dash, jump, duck, and dive to dodge the relentless attacks of the Trial Masters. Every move matters\u2014no buttons, no controllers, just you and your core!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn from Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/extras/Dodge3-_Compressed.gif?t=1739860349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Trial Master brings a new challenge to overcome. Every failure is a lesson in growth. Study their patterns, adapt, and return stronger. It\u2019s not just about reflexes\u2014it\u2019s about evolving into the true Master of Core.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pixel-Perfect Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/extras/Screenshots.gif?t=1739860349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core Trials blends retro charm with modern challenge. Wrapped in nostalgic pixel-art style, it seems simple\u2014but don\u2019t be deceived. Sharp focus is essential. Be slow, and the Masters will humble you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover the Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/extras/Map-_Compressed.gif?t=1739860349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the tainted lands of Amargi. The Masters, once protectors of this realm, now guard forgotten truths. You are the chosen one, the last of many who bore the Core. Journey through the lands, rivers, mountains, and seas to unravel the history.</p>","developers":["Ohilo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549160/header.jpg?t=1739860349","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Monterey (version 12) and up<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple 